      "code": "HAM",
      "date": "2026-11-08T17:16:41.094000+00:00",
      "url": "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-11-08_S%C3%A3o_Paulo_Grand_Prix/2026-11-08_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261108_141621.mp3",
      "unclear": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HAM_44_20261108_141832",
      "driverNumber": 44,
      "code": "HAM",
      "date": "2026-11-08T17:19:12.023000+00:00",
      "url": "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-11-08_S%C3%A3o_Paulo_Grand_Prix/2026-11-08_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261108_141832.mp3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "driver",
          "unclear": true
        },
        {
          "who": "driver",
          "en": "Can I come in now or not?",
          "uk": "Можна заїхати зараз чи ні?",
          "from": 6.4,
          "to": 7.7
        },
        {
          "who": "engineer",
          "en": "Negative, negative, we are not in the crossover yet.",
          "uk": "Ні, ні, ми ще не в точці переходу.",
          "from": 8.0,
          "to": 11.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HAM_44_20261108_142204",
      "driverNumber": 44,
      "code": "HAM",
      "date": "2026-11-08T17:22:47.246000+00:00",
      "url": "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-11-08_S%C3%A3o_Paulo_Grand_Prix/2026-11-08_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261108_142204.mp3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "driver",
          "unclear": true
        },
        {
          "who": "driver",
          "en": "It's on the edge, for sure…",
          "uk": "Це на межі, точно…",
          "from": 5.2,
          "to": 10.4
        },
        {
          "who": "driver",
          "en": "The only place that's slippery is …",
          "uk": "Слизько тільки в одному місці: …",
          "from": 11.3,
          "to": 13.9
        },
        {
          "who": "engineer",
          "en": "Exactly. … We agree, we need to wait a bit.",
          "uk": "Саме так. … Згодні, треба трохи почекати.",
          "from": 14.4,
          "to": 18.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RUS_63_20261108_151725",
      "driverNumber": 63,
      "code": "RUS",
      "date": "2026-11-08T18:17:38.269000+00:00",
      "url": "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-11-08_S%C3%A3o_Paulo_Grand_Prix/2026-11-08_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20261108_151725.mp3",
      "lines": [
